# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a root one (same
# pattern as render-service/). The image needs exactly these out of the repo:
#   video-worker/                      this service
#   marketing/broll/                   the animation kit (not its node_modules or previews)
#   src/ad-videos/{worker-protocol,worker-jobs,overlay-plan,ffmpeg-plan}.mjs
# Everything else is excluded so no app source, no test and no .env can reach a layer.
*
!video-worker/**
video-worker/node_modules
!marketing/broll/**
marketing/broll/node_modules
marketing/broll/previews
!src/ad-videos/worker-protocol.mjs
!src/ad-videos/worker-jobs.mjs
!src/ad-videos/overlay-plan.mjs
!src/ad-videos/ffmpeg-plan.mjs
